The reason these kind of abominations are allowed, the reason these false teachers are able to bring wolves in among the sheep, is because actual Christians have abandoned preaching the whole Bible, in season and out of season, and strayed from practicing the pure religion;

*Pure religion and undefiled before God and the Father is this, To visit the fatherless and widows in their affliction, and to keep himself unspotted from the world.*

If we were good judges of the fatherless, if we were to visit the widows in their affliction, if we were to keep ourselves unspotted from the world, there would be far fewer reprobates made. The sodomites wouldn't be able to recruit those lacking fathers. They would belong to the kingdom of God.
